## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Burst Default (Gold)

- Items: Magic Boots, Berserker's Fury, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Gun, Sea Halberd
- Core: Berserker's Fury, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when enemy mid, roam, and jungle can chain control before you fire a second Lethal Shot.; Rose Gold Meteor over Sea Halberd when Use against magic or mixed burst when surviving the first dive matters more than anti-heal or extra-HP punishment.; Immortality over Sea Halberd when Use after your damage core when one death would decide Lord control or the final base defense.
- Total cost: 12610 gold

Default ranked build that turns Lesley's skill-reset Lethal Shot pattern into repeated crit true-damage picks while keeping the sixth slot ready for anti-heal or defensive swaps.

### Safe Range Sniper (Gold)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Berserker's Fury, Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle, Malefic Gun, Blade of Despair
- Core: Berserker's Fury, Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when your lane is stable and shorter camouflage downtime matters more than the top-speed rotations Rapid Boots buys.; Great Dragon Spear over Malefic Gun when Use when you need post-ultimate movement to kite after checking or finishing a target.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use when magic burst can reach you before Blade of Despair converts into a kill.
- Total cost: 12550 gold

Pick this when the enemy draft gives Lesley long fog angles and isolated targets instead of forced front-to-back DPS checks.

### Anti-Dive Defensive (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Berserker's Fury, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Wind of Nature, Immortality
- Core: Berserker's Fury, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Winter Crown over Wind of Nature when Use against mixed burst or delayed execution combos where stasis buys more time than physical immunity.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use against magic or mixed burst where physical immunity will not block the first lethal combo.; Malefic Gun over Immortality when Use when your frontline can protect you and the fight is decided by first-shot range rather than revive insurance.
- Total cost: 12460 gold

Defensive gold lane setup for Saber, Natalia, Helcurt, Chou, or hard crowd-control drafts that punish greedy sniper positioning.

